/-!
# The proof system: the spine

`Basic.lean` (one name for each object, and the ties), `Postulates.lean` (P1 to P5 in their
mathematical form, the candidate systems, the gauges, the uniqueness theorem), and
`Spine/Quaternion.lean` (every candidate system is the quaternionic plane `ℍ²`), and
`Spine/TwoThings.lean` (the two systems of every candidate system are the model's two systems: the
exchange, the singlet and the comparison, with the spectrum `6¹ ⊕ 2¹⁰ ⊕ (−2)⁵`).
-/
